            "notes": "In the first round, you'll go with   [Iceberg](item_312193a7-1f88-462f-93fe-9a60f4462d47) since you're gonna build around blizzard, this is the best way to start\n\nThe more important common is  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  and the only one who truly matter here \n\nThe two other can be switch depending on your playstyle, but remember that you'll try to make the most money you can on the first round, so play safe, but be annoying : put you walls behind the tank, in front of their healers, block their DPS, protects your team",
