            "notes": "Now in the second round, the best power you can pick is  [Icy Veins](item_2c403951-4f9b-4390-ad1e-aabaa09a6da5) and it is the more important here, you HAVE to buy it : it makes you blizz go from 4.22 dmg to 8.45 and will scale with time \n\nFeel free to sell everything if you have a hard time in the first round, but if you can, keep your  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) since you'll want your  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) maxed \n\nIf you had a really hard time in the first round; know that i'm sorry for you, but just build AP with everything you can;  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) is a good choice since it'll give you more survivability",
