        {
            "id": "269d5161-e53b-4d2b-8ad1-d4a28172b46b",
            "build_id": "81034f39-df65-46d5-9e7c-fd2d66772c9b",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-14T09:31:41.128857+00:00",
            "notes": "In the 3rd round, you'll have to choose between [Cryclone](item_e64001ed-c334-4bd9-8621-03f94efcac07) or [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d) \n\nTake  [Cryclone](item_e64001ed-c334-4bd9-8621-03f94efcac07) if you feel the need to be more defensive : if their tank push you really hard or if they flank you a lot. It will help you have more survivability and may help you take some 1v1 later\n\nOtherwise, if you think you can push a little harder, go for  [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d)  and just put walls everywhere. Block their team, take heights, and escape with it if you need but remerber that it will also make a blizzard and will hurt them a lot\n\nFor your main item, you'll pick  [Sturdy Snowfort](item_afbba267-dff5-4018-a8ab-fa743d128d6b) since you'll take a +25%  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) eveytime you put a wall\n\nWith your current build, your wall will make up to 11.52 dmg per tick and up to 12.29 with the  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)",
