            "notes": "Now, you have to choose between [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) or  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)\n\nMy love pick is  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) since it's really annoying to be slowed and take damage, but  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) can help you finish your target\n\nAs always, you should know what to pick if your economy is not going well. If not, just go full  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)",
