            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-14T09:31:41.128857+00:00",
            "notes": "For your next power, just grab  [Coulder](item_12ad88e8-650a-44ec-b1e1-a39646055d68)\n\nYou know it; now you're a rolling machine with blizzard that should make around 13.82 dmg per ticks\n\nThat's why you're gonna now take  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)  (or  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) depends on your previous round)\n\nNow it's easier for you to get your 1v1, but remeber to check their builds, if they have a burst it make you have a hard time if you hold too long your iceblock \n\nQuick tip for you : if you cannot use your iceblock rn and you need to, just push the button and keep it pushed; it will iceblock you as soon as it's up \nBUT do not full tap it since you will iceblock and then go back to normal",
